ackground:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;cursor:pointer;\">← Back</button><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:6px;background:#16a34a;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">✓ Finish</button></div></div></div></div>"
          }
